network-manager-ms-sso (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Make FHNW AnyConnect first-time authentication choose TOTP reliably
  * Adapt to TOTP, Authenticator number matching, and passkey fallback flows
  * Use a single bounded SAML deadline and faster browser navigation
  * Preserve split OpenConnect output lines during tunnel detection
  * Set explicit NetworkManager VPN activation timeouts for SAML/MFA
  * Declare and preflight all Debian runtime dependencies
  * Avoid repeated browser downloads and nested APT during package configuration

