network-manager-ms-sso (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 2.0.0 release
  * NetworkManager VPN plugin for MS SSO OpenConnect
  * GTK4 editor for GNOME Settings integration
  * Python D-Bus service for VPN connection handling
  * Auth dialog with keyring integration
